{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1560038400, "end_date": 1560643199, "month_true_total": 119, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:52:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "51234676", "author": {"steamid": "76561198142227841", "personaname": "mammoth", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198142227841/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 9490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1340, "last_played": 1732548699, "avatar": "e80de2073e1430e39dbd793212324c5dd329af26"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我还能说什么？矿骡们！干活了！", "timestamp_created": 1560587874, "timestamp_updated": 1560587874, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 13, "weighted_vote_score": "0.655594587326049805", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "51200316", "author": {"steamid": "76561198400422543", "personaname": "Soumuk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198400422543/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 15183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2271, "last_played": 1752229559, "avatar": "80c895ea84f3c58f2fe5824d0502a3ba0bb8322a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "喝酒跳舞就完事了，挖什么矿，打什么虫子！！！", "timestamp_created": 1560405821, "timestamp_updated": 1643899252, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51191505", "author": {"steamid": "76561198238549436", "personaname": "罗庄的冬天", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nanjinglizhi/", "num_games_owned": 2317, "num_reviews": 89, "playtime_forever": 103284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13031, "last_played": 1771646250, "avatar": "d93d86f4ff0143989416062d9bcfef2971f9e7e3"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "最近加了很多好友玩，就更新一下，\n\n市面上很多这类游戏，我统称之为25级类游戏，像鼠疫，杀地板都是，但是这个游戏不同的是，强调合作，\n大部分25级类游戏，拼的就是一个爽感，又因为是PVE占大头，就导致后期都是抢人头，抢数据，虽然这个游戏后期也有很多人抢数据，但是之所以还在源源不断的吸引人，就是因为角色通过各取所长进行合作，从而在人与人之间产生化学反应，工程搭个台子侦查飞上去采矿，很小的动作却是很强的正联结作用。\n\n而大部分25类游戏玩到最后，玩家为了自己爽都各抢各的，全是我的RPG还没飞过去，你的榴弹就把怪炸没了，玩家之间是暗中相互排斥的。这个游戏就是把同类型最头疼的瓶颈，反之变为最强的特色，“没有你，我会很难，有了你，我们无往不胜”，这才是它的精髓。\n================================\n\n一个让人上瘾的，合作性强的游戏，好评率大家也看到了就不用再多说什么\n\n如果你想看一个人人品好不好，是否自私自闭，有无团队意识，执行能力强不强，会不会分主次重点，会不会为他人付出，甚至关键时刻牺牲自己达成目标，这个游戏就是个很好的检测器\n\n“能请您麻利点吗，懒猪，我们有正事要干呢”", "timestamp_created": 1560354607, "timestamp_updated": 1619365405, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.546955287456512451", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51189734", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060053178", "personaname": "晴风", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060053178/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 80849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6550, "last_played": 1784286278, "avatar": "f5e7e5369b47961e810e3468dedacd3b006a7eb5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "对得起这个价钱，50 小时应该都可以搞完所有内容了 （如果你搞不完，那就是游戏更新了）。最近更新的大自爆虫子很好玩。新手入门不推荐水蛭洞穴", "timestamp_created": 1560347407, "timestamp_updated": 1619702953, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.544440865516662598", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51154003", "author": {"steamid": "76561198299683221", "personaname": "SumuXi", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198299683221/", "num_games_owned": 180, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 19996, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 814, "last_played": 1786623589, "avatar": "f2eca8d585fdc2d0d5e7abd8c22437506a89642c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这是一个四人撕逼跑路游戏", "timestamp_created": 1560163120, "timestamp_updated": 1560163120, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}